    {ι : Qbar l ≃+* ℂ} {ξ : G F Ω →* (Qbar l)ˣ} {s c m a π r} (H : OrdForm ι ξ s c m a π r) {wt HT} (hG : UpperTheory.Gal.SV.IsGalRS π ι r wt HT) (w) :
